.*
.* QUIAUTUSR: DSPAUTUSR, the user profiles with their groups and when
.* their passwords last changed; F11 the password levels a profile has
.* a password for (golden/verified/oracle71/panels/dspautusr-f11). The
.* driver indents the level values two columns, under their headings.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DATECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LVLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NETCL BASETYPE='CHAR 9'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=MGTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=AUUSER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=AUGROUP CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=AUPWDCHG CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=AUNOPWD CLASS=FLAGCL.
:VAR NAME=AUTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=AULVL01 CLASS=LVLCL.
:VAR NAME=AULVL23 CLASS=LVLCL.
:VAR NAME=AUNETSVR CLASS=NETCL.
:VAR NAME=AULCLPWD CLASS=MGTCL.
:VAR NAME=AUVIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&AUVIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&AUVIEW. EQ "2"'.
:LISTDEF NAME=USERS VARS='AUUSER AUGROUP AUPWDCHG AUNOPWD AUTEXT AULVL01 AULVL23 AUNETSVR AULCLPWD'.
:KEYL NAME=AUTKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=Password Level Information
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=Text Information
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPAUTUSR HELP=HLPAUT KEYL=AUTKEYS.Display Authorized Users
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=USERS SCROLL=YES VIEWS=2.
:LISTCOL VAR=AUUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.User Profile
:LISTCOL VAR=AUGROUP USAGE=OUTPUT.Group Profile
:LISTGRP COL=PWD.Password
:LISTCOL VAR=AUPWDCHG USAGE=OUTPUT.Last Changed
:LISTCOL VAR=AUNOPWD USAGE=OUTPUT.No Password
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=AUTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTCOL NAME=PWDCHG VAR=AUPWDCHG USAGE=OUTPUT.Password Last Changed
:LISTCOL VAR=AULVL01 USAGE=OUTPUT.Level 0 or 1 Password
:LISTCOL VAR=AULVL23 USAGE=OUTPUT.Level 2 or 3 Password
:LISTCOL VAR=AUNETSVR USAGE=OUTPUT.Netserver Password
:LISTCOL VAR=AULCLPWD USAGE=OUTPUT.Local Pwd Mgt
:LISTVIEW COLS='AUUSER AUGROUP PWD AUTEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='AUUSER AUGROUP PWDCHG AULVL01 AULVL23 AUNETSVR AULCLPWD'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPAUT.Display Authorized Users - Help
:P.This display lists every user profile with the group it belongs to,
the date its password was last changed and its text. An X under No
Password marks a profile that has no password and so cannot sign on.
F11 shows instead which password levels each profile has a password
for and whether its password is managed here.
:P.SEQ(*GRPPRF) on the command lists the profiles by group.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
